translit:
[Verse 1]
Paavak kushtam pelaveenam
Neengap paavi odi vaa;
Esu unnai ratchikkavae
Kavalaiyaai nirkiraar.

[Chorus]
Ratchippaith thaedu, Karththaraich saer
Avar naamaththaip potru;
Karththar aala varugiraar;
Kanam pugazh avarkkae.

[Verse 2]
Unnai anbaai azhaikkiraar,
Uththama viswaasamum,
Un paava manasthaapamum
Saerkkum jeeva paadhaiyil.

[Chorus]
Ratchippaith thaedu, Karththaraich saer
Avar naamaththaip potru;
Karththar aala varugiraar;
Kanam pugazh avarkkae.

[Verse 3]
Kanaavil avar kaattattum;
Naan thagudhi enbadhai,
Endru ennip pinvaangiyae
Nillaadhae nee paaviyae!

[Chorus]
Ratchippaith thaedu, Karththaraich saer
Avar naamaththaip potru;
Karththar aala varugiraar;
Kanam pugazh avarkkae.

[Verse 4]
Kalaiththu nondha paaviyae!
Karththar thanjam unaru;
Kaalam kadaththi nirkaadhae;
Veen yosanai seiyaadhae.

[Chorus]
Ratchippaith thaedu, Karththaraich saer
Avar naamaththaip potru;
Karththar aala varugiraar;
Kanam pugazh avarkkae.

